# dist/ used to be intentionally committed here (this package was
# installed directly via a git+ssh URL, so its own repo had to carry
# built output). As of the move into admin-panel-rooh-v2, it's consumed
# as a workspace:* dependency instead, so dist/ goes back to being a
# gitignored build artifact like any other workspace package's — see
# the root .gitignore's comment on packages/authz-tenant-kit for the
# same pattern. Run `bun run build` after any change to src/lib.
/dist
